iform POVM defect bounds, and the eight-element `21/32` scalar result in a\n  new module `MIPStarRE/QPBT/Combining/QuadraticPointObstruction.lean`\n  (eleven unique declarations retained, statements unchanged).\n- Reuse merged PR #299's deterministic measurement and effect APIs\n  (`deterministicMeasurement`, `deterministicMeasurement_projective` in\n  `Test/Completeness/HonestStrategy/MeasurementFamily.lean`, and\n  `Measurement.postprocess_comp`) instead of the three generic duplicates the\n  saved packet carried. No shared-helper move, no import cycle, and no change\n  to `Combining/Apply.lean`, `PointErrorObstruction.lean`, the paper mirrors or\n  the blueprint chapters.\n- Archive PR #547's original cost and audit record byte-for-byte (116-line,\n  6524-byte suffix) under a valid YAML header in\n  `audits/2026-09-12_issue511-independent-finite-obstruction.md`.\n- Add a limited current-status cross-reference to the existing paper-gap note\n  `docs/paper-gaps/qpbt_combined-lines-error-term.tex`.\n\nScope is deliberately narrow: these are auxiliary, formalization-only\nobstruction results. No full line-law transport, no source theorem, and no\nblueprint `\\leanok` is claimed; the `21/256` X-axis mixture contribution stays\nprose, and the three open `Apply.lean` statements are untouched.\n\n### Testing\n\n- Current-head CI passed all nine contexts in 248 seconds on `1086ce4c`.\n  Blueprint rendering and LDT statement-origin were skipped by changed-path rules.\n- The rooted blueprint axiom audit passed 1659 declarations with zero failures\n  and three existing statement-level warnings.\n- Independent bounded recheck5243960797 approved the corrected docstring locator\n  and unchanged contribution. Its focused Lean check passed without diagnostics.\n  The first full review5243849416 supplies the mathematical and provenance review.\n- Retained author checks include the targeted module/root checks, standard-only\n  axiom probes, paper-gap and blueprint checks, and normal commit/push hooks.\n  The eleven obstruction contracts and historical records keep their stated scope.\n\n---\n\nAddresses issue #511 without closing it; issue #511 and PR #547 stay open until\nthis replacement is integrated.\n", "created_at": "2026-09-18T02:42:48Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T03:49:58Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": "9a25a57e55dc4a61b890cdb2a131ada6d6b4841b", "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "labels": [{"id": 12025010884, "node_id": "LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8axA", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/formalization", "name": "formalization", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": "Lean formalization of a mathematical statement", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "milestone": null, "draft": false, "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/587/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/587/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/issues/587/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/statuses/1086ce4c9aa5febc5d5acf026753f03757d2ce4e", "head": {"label": "Dengnifer:issue-511-preserve-quadratic-obstruction-20260918", "ref": "issue-511-preserve-quadratic-obstruction-20260918", "sha": "1086ce4c9aa5febc5d5acf026753f03757d2ce4e", "user": {"login": "Dengnifer", "id": 89234078, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg5MjM0MDc4", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89234078?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer", "html_url": "https://github.com/Dengnifer", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/gists{/gist